      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1317929182,
      "text": "Xylia xylocarpa is a species of tree in the mimosoid clade of the subfamily Caesalpinioideae of the family Fabaceae."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Xylia xylocarpa",
